              <li>Implied gap versus assessed value: ${escapePrintableHtml(marketSaleModel.impliedDifference != null ? `${marketSaleModel.impliedDifference >= 0 ? "+" : ""}${$f(Math.abs(marketSaleModel.impliedDifference))}` : "-")}</li>
